  "config": {
    "name": "phase2b-v2-analysis-seeds-logprob",
    "command": "analyze_seeds",
    "description": "Phase 2b (identity v2) seed-level analysis on TEST: the same seed-level contrasts on the log-prob A/B score (secondary). Six arms x four seeds (A1-A6), the six released adapters as fixed single runs. Per-seed contrasts paired by seed; 95% CI combining seed-to-seed variation (Student-t, 3 df) with question sampling (10,000 question-clustered resamples, seed 0); prediction intervals for a new seed. Pre-registered in docs/preregistration/phase2b-section31-seeds.md \u00a76, as amended by docs/preregistration/phase2b-amendment-1-identity-v2.md. Output committed under msm/analyses/.\n",
